  "brief_rationale": "The model correctly identifies the family proxy context and systematically covers infection/sepsis red flags, wound ischemia, allergic reaction symptoms, medication allergy history timelines, and result interpretation boundaries. It addresses all seven responsibility-chain items without serious or minor error. High-order points HO1 (correcting thrombus/knee/wound conflation), HO3 (avoiding dual misclassification of rash), and HO4 (dynamic reprioritization to emergency) are triggered and completed with meaningful trajectory impact. HO2 (discovering hidden facts) is partially triggered but never reaches targeted non-accusatory elicitation; HO4 also manifests in multiple dynamic shifts. Overall, at least two complete HOs plus partial marks on HO2 and a third manifest HO4 instance. No important non-chain defect is present. Closure is safe, traceable, and validly closed with explicit confirmation of understanding.",
