    "citations": [
      {
        "event_id": "lite_evt_00266",
        "explanation": "Model confirms family understanding of escalation criteria and plan, and provides symmetrical teach-back with action boundary.",
        "quote": "现在继续由病区团队结合正式药敏、炎症指标和打开后的创面情况决定是否调抗菌药、继续负压、再清创或准备修复/植皮"
      }
    ],
    "executable": true,
    "explanation": "Closure provides specific action items, responsible teams, and timing for both escalation and non-escalation paths; family confirms understanding and willingness to act.",
