      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00031",
          "explanation": "Model compares rash area with application area and asks about timing, resolution on stopping, and systemic symptoms to avoid both misclassification of all rashes as allergy and missing a drug reaction.",
          "quote": "既往擦药后起红疹，应先记录为“疑似外用药过敏，药名及反应待核实”，并尽量找出当时药膏的名称、包装或处方，说明涂后多久出现、是否瘙痒/水疱、停药后是否缓解。"
        }
      ],
      "completion": "complete",
      "explanation": "HO3 is triggered and completed. The model integrates differential diagnostic reasoning: it asks for detailed description of the rash, its timing relative to drug use, whether it resolved on stopping, and whether there are systemic symptoms. This balances the risk of over-attributing to allergy and missing a drug reaction.",
      "ho_id": "HO3",
      "meaningful_trajectory_impact": true,
      "triggered": true
